flowchart TD
    User["Next.js Web UI / Customer Dashboard"]
    Gateway["API Gateway (FastAPI)"]
    ChatSvc["Chat Service"]
    Orchestrator["AI Orchestrator"]
    SupportAgent["Support Agent"]
    ProductAgent["Product Agent"]
    OrderAgent["Order Agent"]
    RefundAgent["Refund Agent"]
    EscalationAgent["Escalation Agent"]
    
    RAGSvc["RAG Service"]
    EmbedSvc["Embedding Service"]
    ProductSvc["Product Service"]
    OrderSvc["Order Service"]
    RefundSvc["Refund Service"]
    TicketSvc["Ticket Service"]
    NotifSvc["Notification Service"]

    Postgres[("PostgreSQL + pgvector")]
    Redis[("Redis Cache")]
    Kafka["Apache Kafka Event Bus"]
    Prometheus["Prometheus / Grafana"]

    User <-->|REST / WebSocket| Gateway
    Gateway --> ChatSvc
    Gateway --> ProductSvc
    Gateway --> OrderSvc
    Gateway --> TicketSvc
    Gateway --> RefundSvc

    ChatSvc --> Orchestrator
    Orchestrator --> SupportAgent
    Orchestrator --> ProductAgent
    Orchestrator --> OrderAgent
    Orchestrator --> RefundAgent
    Orchestrator --> EscalationAgent

    SupportAgent --> RAGSvc
    RAGSvc --> EmbedSvc
    RAGSvc --> Postgres

    ProductAgent --> ProductSvc
    OrderAgent --> OrderSvc
    RefundAgent --> RefundSvc
    EscalationAgent --> TicketSvc

    OrderSvc --> Kafka
    RefundSvc --> Kafka
    TicketSvc --> Kafka
    Kafka --> NotifSvc
    NotifSvc --> Postgres

    Gateway -.-> Redis
    Prometheus -.-> Gateway
